
Usage: /UNINVITE <username>
  This  command  allows  you  to uninvite those you have inivited.
  /UNINVITE  does  NOT boot the user out of the channel.  Use /KICK to
  do so.  /UNINVITE by itself will display the list of users currently
  invited  to this channel.  Only channel operators are allowed to use
  this command.

  Examples:
     /UNINVITE john
     /UNINVITE *

  See Also:
     /INVITE
     /KICK

